The [[Rat]] is a [[Pet]] available in the shop to [[Ranger]]s who have [[Big Bowl of Treats]], at common rarity. Every few seconds, the [[Rat]] deals 5 {{icon/effect}}-damage and has a chance of inflicting {{icon/poison}} and/or {{icon/blind}}. The [[Rat]] crafts into the [[Rat Chef]] using a [[Healing Herbs]], although this isn't a straight upgrade, as the [[Rat Chef]] does something completely different.
